  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Economic Opportunities for the Poor (EOP) - Sri Lanka</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Economic Opportunities for the Poor (EOP) Program in Sri Lanka aims to stimulate inclusive, private sector-led economic growth and poverty reduction. The overall goal of EOP is to stimulate economic growth that benefits the prospective participants through the engagement with the private sector. The portfolio focuses on high potential industries, economic sectors that have a strong potential both to grow over the medium term and to include and benefit poor and disadvantaged groups in their economic roles as producers, workers, entrepreneurs and consumers. The three main projects under EOP are: the Market Development Facility (MDF); Skills for Inclusive Economic Growth (S4IG); and Local Empowerment through Economic Development (LEED).</narrative>
  </description>
